    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It seems like a lot of these \"protections\" or tariffs are being framed as necessary to fix unfairness. Do you think the move toward more nationalistic trade policies is actually a step backward for global stability, or is it just a necessary correction to the way globalism was handled for the last few decades?",
